title: The 'graph' is the user's collection of knowledge.
pid: d4988763-2303-48e9-ab1a-b46021b00a96
body: |2-
  The user need not be the sole author --
  Skg lets you integrate other authors' notes into your own,
  and manipulate them as if you did own them.
  More on the graph [[id:4442813b-6744-4551-ba11-efd402878ed4][below]].
